# MoP Classic (5.4.x) API Compatibility Rules

## ❌ APIs NOT Available in MoP Classic
- `C_Timer.NewTimer()` / `C_Timer.After()` - Use `CreateFrame("Frame"):SetScript("OnUpdate")` instead
- `SetBackdrop()` on all frame types - Limited support, avoid or use alternatives
- `AddMaskTexture()` / `CreateMaskTexture()` - Not supported, use `SetClipsChildren(true)` instead
- Modern backdrop templates like `BackdropTemplate`

## ✅ Use These Alternatives
```lua
-- Instead of C_Timer.After(5, function)
local timer = CreateFrame("Frame")
local endTime = GetTime() + 5.0
timer:SetScript("OnUpdate", function(self, elapsed)
    if GetTime() >= endTime then
        -- your code here
        timer:SetScript("OnUpdate", nil)
        timer:Hide()
    end
end)

-- Instead of AddMaskTexture()
frame:SetClipsChildren(true)
-- Size and position content to stay within bounds

-- For text layering
fontString = frame:CreateFontString(nil, "BACKGROUND", "ChatFontNormal")
```

## 🎯 Safe MoP Classic Patterns
- `CreateFrame()` for all UI elements
- `SetVertexColor()` for texture tinting
- `SetDrawLayer()` for proper layering
- `SetFrameLevel()` for z-ordering
- Manual timer management with `OnUpdate`
- Texture coordinate manipulation with `SetTexCoord()`
